<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Efezyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">EFEZYEN YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efezyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ef</para>
  <para style="mt1">EFEZYEN YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Paul <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:1">II Kor 1:1</ref></char></note>yon apot Jésus Kri pa volonte a Bondye, a sen ki an Éphèse yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:2">Kol 1:2</ref></char></note>ki fidèl nan Jésus Kri: <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Wo 1:7</ref></char></note>Lagras pou nou ak lapè ki soti nan Bondye, Papa nou, ak Senyè a, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Beni se Bondye, Papa Senyè nou an Jésus Kri, ki te beni nou avèk tout benediksyon Lespri a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:20">Ef 1:20</ref></char></note>nan lye selès an Kris yo. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Jis jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:10">Ef 2:10</ref></char></note>Li te chwazi nou nan Li, menm avan fondasyon mond lan, pou nou ta kapab sen e san fot devan Li. Nan lanmou Li, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:29">Wo 8:29</ref></char></note>chwazi nou oparavan pou adopsyon kòm fis Li, atravè Jésus Kri, selon dous entansyon a volonte Li. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:12">Ef 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 1:14">14</ref></char></note>Pou lwanj a glwa a gras Li a, ke Li te bannou ak liberalite nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref></char></note>Li menm Ki Byeneme a. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1:14</ref></char></note>Nan Li nou gen redanmsyon pa san Li, padon pou transgresyon nou yo selon richès a gras Li, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ke Li te vide sou nou. Nan tout sajès ak konesans, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:25">Wo 11:25</ref></char></note>fè nou konnen mistè a volonte Li, selon dous entansyon Li; sa ke li te deja planifye nan Li menm nan, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />avèk yon plan pou fè sa dewoule <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mc 1:15</ref></char></note>lè tan an fin akonpli, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1:16</ref>,<ref loc="COL 1:20">20</ref></char></note>reyini tout bagay nan Kris la, bagay nan syèl yo ak bagay sou latè yo. Nan Li menm <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />nou vin genyen yon eritaj osi, ki te chwazi oparavan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:28">Wo 8:28</ref></char></note>selon plan pa L. Se konsa, Li fè tout bagay mache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:11">Wo 9:11</ref></char></note>selon konsèy volonte pa Li, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />afenke nou menm ki te premye espere nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:6">Ef 1:6</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 1:14">14</ref></char></note>Kris la, ta kapab sèvi kòm lwanj a glwa Li. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Nan Li menm, nou tout osi, lè nou fin tande mesaj Verite a, Levanjil Sali a; akoz nou menm tou te kwè, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:30">Ef 4:30</ref></char></note>sele nan Li menm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:33">Trav 2:33</ref></char></note>Lespri Sen a pwomès la, <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:22">II Kor 1:22</ref></char></note>bay a nou menm kòm yon pwomès eritaj nou an, avèk plan redanmsyon a sila ki vrèman pou Bondye yo, pou lwanj a glwa Li.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Pou rezon sa a, mwen menm tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:4">I Kor 1:4</ref></char></note>lè mwen te tande de lafwa nan Senyè a Jésus Kri nou an, ki egziste pami nou ak lanmou nou pou tout sen yo, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:8">Wo 1:8</ref></char></note>pa janm sispann bay remèsiman pou nou menm, pandan m ap nonmen non nou nan lapriyè <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:17">Jn 20:17</ref></char></note>Bondye a Senyè nou an Jésus Kri, Papa laglwa a, kapab bannou yon lespri sajès ak revelasyon nan konesans a Li menm. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />M priye pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:6">II Kor 4:6</ref></char></note>zye a kè nou kapab klere, pou nou kapab konnen kisa ki esperans apèl Li a, ak sa ki richès laglwa eritaj Li a pami sen yo. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Epi sa ki se grandè san parèy a pouvwa Li anvè nou menm ki kwè yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:7">Ef 3:7</ref></char></note>selon travay de fòs pouvwa Li a. <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />Se travay sa a ke Li te fè rive an Kris la lè Li te leve li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>soti nan lanmò a pou te fè L chita sou bò dwat Li nan lye selès yo, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />pi wo anpil pase <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mat 28:18</ref></char></note>tout gouvènans yo, tout otorite, tout pouvwa, tout wayòm, ak tout non ki nonmen, non sèlman nan tan sila a, men nan tan k ap vini an. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Epi Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Sòm 8:6</ref></char></note>mete tout bagay an soumisyon anba pye Jésus, e te fè Li tèt sou tout bagay a legliz la, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />ki se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:27">I Kor 12:27</ref></char></note>kò Li, yon prezantasyon konplè de Li menm ki konplete tout bagay nèt.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Konsa, nou te vin vivan an nan lè nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:5">Ef 2:5</ref></char></note>fin mouri nan transgresyon ak peche nou yo. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Nan sila yo menm, nou te konn mache oparavan yo, selon kous a mond sa a, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Jn 12:31</ref></char></note>prens a pwisans de lè a, lespri a ki koulye a menm ap aji nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:6">Ef 5:6</ref></char></note>fis a dezobeyisans yo. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Pami yo, nou tou te konn viv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:16">Gal 5:16</ref></char></note>nan dezi lachè nou, nan satisfè sa dezi lachè a ak lespri a te mande nou fè. Nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:14">Wo 2:14</ref></char></note>pa lanati, zanfan lakòlè menm jan ak tout lòt yo. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Men Bondye, ki rich an mizerikòd, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Jn 3:16</ref></char></note>gran amou Li ke Li te sèvi nan renmen nou an, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />ki menm lè nou te deja mouri nan transgresyon nou yo, Li te fè nou viv ansanm avèk Kris. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:11">Trav 15:11</ref></char></note>Pa lagras nou te sove a. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2:12</ref></char></note>leve nou avèk Li, epi te fè nou chita avèk Li nan lye selès yo, nan Kris Jésus, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />pou nan tan k ap vini yo, Li ta kapab montre nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:4">Wo 2:4</ref></char></note>richès a gras Li ki pi gran pase tout bagay, nan dousè Li anvè nou nan Jésus Kri. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Paske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:11">Trav 15:11</ref></char></note>pa lagras ke nou sove atravè lafwa. E sa pa de nou menm, se kado a Bondye a. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:28">Wo 3:28</ref></char></note> Li pa pa mwayen de zèv yo, pou pèsòn pa kapab vante tèt li. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Paske nou se èv Li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3:10</ref></char></note>kreye an Jésus Kri pou fè bon zèv, ke Bondye te prepare davans pou nou ta kapab mache nan yo.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Konsa, sonje, ke oparavan, nou menm, pèp etranje nan lachè yo, ki rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:28">Wo 2:28</ref></char></note>“Ensikonsi” pa sila ki rele pwòp tèt yo “Sikonsi” yo, ki fèt nan lachè pa men a lòm, <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />sonje ke nou te nan tan sa a separe de Kris, andeyò de kominote Israël la, e etranje selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:17">Gal 3:17</ref></char></note>akò pwomès yo, san espwa, e san Bondye nan mond lan. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Men koulye a nan Kris Jésus, nou menm ki te oparavan byen lwen, nou gen tan vin touprè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:25">Wo 3:25</ref></char></note>pa san a Kris la. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Paske Li menm, Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:6">És 9:6</ref></char></note>lapè nou, ki te fè de gwoup sa yo vin yon sèl, e ki te kraze baryè miray divizyon an, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />lè L te aboli nan lachè Li, rayisman ki se lalwa kòmandman yo ki te nan tout règ yo, pou nan Li menm, Li ta kapab fè ak de pèp sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3:28</ref></char></note>yon sèl òm tounèf e konsa etabli lapè. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Konsa, Li ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:18">II Kor 5:18</ref></char></note>rekonsilye yo toulède nan yon sèl kò pou Bondye atravè lakwa a, ki te mete rayisman sa a lanmò. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />“Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">És 57:19</ref></char></note>Li te vin preche lapè a nou ki te byen lwen an, e lapè a sila ki te touprè yo.” <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Paske atravè Li menm, nou toulède gen aksè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:13">I Kor 12:13</ref></char></note>yon sèl Lespri a Papa a. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Konsa, nou pa etranje ak moun deyò ankò, men nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:20">Fil 3:20</ref></char></note>sitwayen ansanm avèk sen yo, e manm fanmi a lakay Bondye a, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />ki te bati sou fondasyon apot ak pwofèt yo, Kris Jésus Li menm kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sòm 118:22</ref></char></note>wòch la ki fòme ang prensipal la. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Nan Li menm tout kay la bati ansanm, epi ap grandi pou devni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">I Kor 3:16</ref></char></note>yon tanp ki sen nan Senyè a. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Nan Li menm, nou osi ap vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:9">I Kor 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 3:16">16</ref></char></note>bati ansanm pou vini yon kote pou Lespri Bondye a kapab rete.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Pou rezon sa a, mwen, Paul <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:18">Trav 23:18</ref></char></note>prizonye a Kris Jésus a, pou koz a nou, pèp etranje yo, <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />si vrèman nou te tande de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:10">Ef 1:10</ref></char></note>jerans a gras Bondye ke mwen te resevwa pou livre bay nou an, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:12">Gal 1:12</ref></char></note>pa revelasyon mwen te vin konnen mistè a, sou ki mwen te deja ekri kèk mo a. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Pa referans a sa, lè nou li, nou kapab konprann konesans mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:25">Wo 11:25</ref></char></note>mistè a Kris la, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />ki, nan lòt jenerasyon yo pa t konnen pa fis a lòm yo, men koulye a li revele a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:28">I Kor 12:28</ref></char></note>sen apot Li yo ak pwofèt yo nan Lespri a. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Pou detaye byen klè, ke pèp etranje yo se eritye egal e manb parèy nan kò a, epi patisipan egal nan pwomès a Kris Jésus a selon levanjil la.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal 3:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:23">I Kor 1:23</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 1:25">25</ref></char></note>Sou pwomès sa a, mwen te vin yon sèvitè selon don lagras Bondye a, ke m te resevwa selon travay pouvwa Li a. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />A mwen menm, pi piti pami tout sen yo, gras sa a te bay, pou preche a pèp etranje yo, tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:4">Wo 2:4</ref></char></note>richès ensondab a Kris yo. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Epi pou fè tout moun wè, sa ki se jerans a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25">Wo 16:25</ref></char></note>mistè a ki te kache pandan tan yo nan Bondye, ki te kreye tout bagay yo. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Pou tout sajès a Bondye a ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:12">I Pi 1:12</ref></char></note>vin konnen koulye a atravè legliz la, a tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:12">Ef 6:12</ref></char></note>pouvwa ak otorite nan lye selès yo. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:11">Ef 1:11</ref></char></note>Sa te an akò avèk plan etènèl la ke Li te reyalize nan Kris Jésus, Senyè nou an. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:18">Ef 2:18</ref></char></note>Li menm, nou gen kouraj pa lafwa pou apwoche Li ak konfyans. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Konsa, mwen mande nou pou nou pa dekouraje nan tribilasyon m ap pase<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:1">Ef 3:1</ref></char></note>pou nou yo, paske yo se glwa nou.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Pou rezon sila a, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:10">Fil 2:10</ref></char></note>koube jenou m devan Papa de Senyè nou, Jésus Kris. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Nan Li menm, tout fanmi nan syèl la ak sou tè a jwenn non yo, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />pou Li kapab bannou, selon richès laglwa Li, ke nou kapab ranfòse avèk pouvwa, atravè Lespri Li a ki fonse nan enteryè lòm nan. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Pou Kris kapab demere nan kè nou pa lafwa, pou nou kapab, byen fonde e rasine nan lanmou, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />pou nou kapab konprann avèk tout sen yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:8">Job 11:8</ref></char></note>sa ki se lajè, longè, wotè, ak pwofondè a, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />epi pou nou konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:35">Wo 8:35</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 8:39">39</ref></char></note>lanmou a Kris la ki depase konesans, pou nou ta kapab vin ranpli nèt ak tout sa ki nan Bondye yo.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Koulye a, a Li menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:8">II Kor 9:8</ref></char></note>kapab fè bokou, bokou plis, de tout sa ke nou mande oubyen panse, selon pouvwa ki travay anndan nou an, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:36">Wo 11:36</ref></char></note>a Li menm laglwa nan legliz la ak nan Kris Jésus a, a tout jenerasyon yo pou tout tan e pou tout tan. Amèn.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Konsa, mwen menm, prizonye a Senyè a, mwen priye nou pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:10">Ef 2:10</ref></char></note>mache nan yon manyè dign de apèl avèk sila yo te rele nou an, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />avèk tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12">Kol 3:12</ref></char></note>imilite ak dousè, avèk pasyans, nan montre tolerans pou youn lòt nan lanmou, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />nan rete dilijan pou konsève <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:14">Kol 3:14</ref></char></note>linite Lespri a, e nan lyen lapè. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4">I Kor 12:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:18">Ef 1:18</ref></char></note>Gen yon kò ak yon Lespri, menm jan ke nou te rele nan yon sèl espwa de apèl nou an; <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:6">I Kor 8:6</ref></char></note>yon sèl Senyè, yon sèl lafwa, yon sèl batèm, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />yon sèl Bondye e Papa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:36">Wo 11:36</ref></char></note>tout moun ki, sou tout bagay, pami tout bagay e nan tout bagay. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Men a nou chak, gras te vin bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>selon mezi don a Kris la.<verse eid="EPH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Konsa sa ekri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 68:18">Sòm 68:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Lè Li te monte anlè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">Li te mennen kon kaptif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">kaptivite a menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">e Li te bay don a lèzòm.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Alò, fraz sila a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:13">Jn 3:13</ref></char></note>“Li te monte”, kisa sa vle di eksepte ke Li osi te desann anba nan pati ki pi fon nan latè a? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Sila ki te desann nan se Li menm tou ki te monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:6">Eb 7:6</ref></char></note>bokou pi wo pase tout syèl yo, pou Li ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:23">Ef 1:23</ref></char></note>akonpli tout bagay.<verse eid="EPH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Konsa, Li te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:1">Trav 13:1</ref></char></note>kèk kòm apot, kèk kòm pwofèt, kèk kòm evanjelis, e kèk kòm pastè ak enstriktè, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:9">II Kwo 13:9</ref></char></note>pou preparasyon a fidèl yo pou zèv sèvis la, pou l ranfòse kò a Kris la, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />jiskaske nou tout vin rive nan linite lafwa a, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:17">Ef 1:17</ref></char></note>konesans a Fis Bondye a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:14">Eb 5:14</ref></char></note>moun ki gen matirite, jiska mezi a wotè ki apatyen a Kris la. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Kòm rezilta, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:20">I Kor 14:20</ref></char></note>pa dwe timoun ankò, ki vannen toupatou pa chak vag lanmè a, e ki vin pote pa chak van doktrin ki fèt pa twonpri a lòm, avèk tout koken ak manèv desepsyon; <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />men pandan n ap pale verite a nan lanmou, nou dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:21">Ef 2:21</ref></char></note>grandi nan tout aspè nan Sila, ki se tèt la, Kris Li menm. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Nan Li menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:4">Wo 12:4</ref></char></note>tout kò a, ki fòme e ki kenbe ansanm pa sa ke chak jwenn founi, selon pwòp fonksyon a chak grenn pati, ki fè kò a grandi pou l byen bati pou kont li nan lanmou.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Donk, mwen di sa e konfime ansanm avèk Senyè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2">Ef 2:2</ref></char></note>pou nou pa mache ankò kòm pèp etranje yo mache, nan vanite a panse yo, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />avèk yon konprann ki byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:21">Wo 1:21</ref></char></note>fonse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:12">Ef 2:12</ref></char></note>andeyò de lavi Bondye a, akoz de inyorans ki nan yo, akoz kè yo ki di. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Konsa yo menm, ki te vin ensansib, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:24">Wo 1:24</ref></char></note>livre tèt yo a tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:5">Kol 3:5</ref></char></note>sansyalite, pou pratike tout kalite salte, e yo te vin voras. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Men nou pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:29">Mat 11:29</ref></char></note>aprann Kris nan fason sa a, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />si vrèman nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:14">Wo 10:14</ref></char></note>te menm tande Li e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:7">Kol 2:7</ref></char></note>te enstwi nan Li, jis nou konnen verite a se nan Jésus. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Sa vle di ke nan referans a jan nou te konn viv la, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:1">Eb 12:1</ref></char></note>mete sou kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:6">Wo 6:6</ref></char></note>ansyen moun nan, ki konwonpi an akò avèk pasyon twonpri yo, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />epi pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Wo 12:2</ref></char></note>vin tounèf nan lespri a panse nou, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />pou nou kapab mete sou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3:10</ref></char></note>nouvo moun nan, ki fèt nan limaj Bondye, e ki te kreye nan ladwati, ak sentete de verite a.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Pou sa, mete akote sa ki fo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Za 8:16</ref></char></note>e “pale verite a, nou chak avèk vwazen nou”, paske nou se manm a youn lòt. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Sòm 4:4</ref></char></note> “Fè fache, e malgre sa pa peche”; pa kite solèy la kouche pandan nou fache a, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />epi pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Wo 12:19</ref></char></note>bay Dyab la opòtinite. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Sila ki vòlè a pa dwe vòlè ankò, men pito, fòk li travay, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:11">I Tes 4:11</ref></char></note>fè avèk pwòp men li sa ki bon, pou li kapab gen yon bagay pou pataje avèk sila ki gen bezwen yo. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Pa kite okenn vye mo sal sòti nan bouch nou, men sèlman kalite mo ki bon pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:19">Wo 14:19</ref></char></note>edifikasyon selon bezwen moman an, pou li kapab bay gras a sila ki tande l yo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Pa atriste Lespri Sen Bondye ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:33">Jn 3:33</ref></char></note>sele nou pou jou redanmsyon an. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:14">Wo 3:14</ref></char></note>Ke tout rankin nan kè, san wo, kòlè, zen, ak kout lang vin retire pami nou, ansanm ak tout malveyans. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Sèvi dousè a youn lòt, avèk bon kè, k ap padone youn lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mat 6:14</ref></char></note>jis jan ke Bondye nan Kris la te osi padone nou an.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mat 5:48</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, se pou nou vin imitatè a Bondye, kòm zanfan byeneme. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:15">Wo 14:15</ref></char></note>Mache nan lanmou, jan Kris osi te renmen nou, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2:20</ref></char></note>bay tèt Li pou nou, kòm yon ofrann ak yon sakrifis a Bondye, kon yon pafen ki santi bon.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Men ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:5">Kol 3:5</ref></char></note>imoralite, salte, ak move lanvi pa menm dwe nonmen pami nou. Se konsa li dwe ye pami fidèl yo. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Nou pa dwe gen pawòl malonèt, pawòl san sans, avèk vye blag, ki pa dign, men de preferans, bay remèsiman a Bondye.<verse eid="EPH 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Paske nou konnen sa byen klè, ke pa gen ni moun imoral, ni moun ki nan salte, ni moun ki gen lanvi nan kè yo, ni moun k ap sèvi zidòl, k ap gen yon eritaj nan wayòm Kris ak Bondye a.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:8">Kol 2:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa kite pèsòn twonpe nou avèk pawòl vid yo, paske akoz de bagay sa yo lakòlè Bondye vini sou fis ki pa obeyisan yo. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Konsa, pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:6">Ef 3:6</ref></char></note>vin yon pati ak yo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Paske avan sa nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2">Ef 2:2</ref></char></note>te tenèb, men koulye a nou se Limyè nan Senyè a. Mache tankou pitit a Limyè. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:22">Gal 5:22</ref></char></note>fwi a Limyè a se nan tout bonte, ladwati, ak verite, <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Wo 12:2</ref></char></note>ki fè prev de sa k ap fè Senyè a plezi. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Pa patisipe nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Wo 13:12</ref></char></note>zèv tenèb ki pa janm pote fwi yo, men de preferans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:20">I Tim 5:20</ref></char></note>ekspoze yo. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Paske se yon gwo wont pou nou menm pale de bagay ki fèt an sekrè pa yo menm. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Men tout bagay vin vizib <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:20">Jn 3:20</ref></char></note>lè yo ekspoze pa limyè a, paske tout bagay ki vin vizib se limyè. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Pou rezon sa a Li di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:17">És 51:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Leve, sila k ap dòmi an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Leve sòti nan lanmò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">E Kris va klere sou ou.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Konsa, fè atansyon sou jan nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:2">Ef 5:2</ref></char></note>mache, pa tankou yon moun ki pa saj, men tankou yon moun ki saj. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4:5</ref></char></note>Fè plis ke posib avèk tan nou, paske jou yo move. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Konsa, pinga nou vin moun ensanse, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Wo 12:2</ref></char></note>konprann byen kisa volonte Bondye a ye. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:1">Pwov 20:1</ref></char></note>pinga nou vin sou avèk diven, paske sa se banbòch, men se pou nou ranpli avèk Lespri a. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16">Kol 3:16</ref></char></note>Pale avèk youn lòt avèk Sòm, avèk chan, e avèk kantik Lespri Bondye yo. Chante e fè mizik avèk kè nou a Senyè a. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:8">Wo 1:8</ref></char></note>Toujou bay remèsiman a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:24">I Kor 15:24</ref></char></note>Bondye, Papa a, pou tout bagay nan non a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, Papa a menm, <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:13">Gal 5:13</ref></char></note>avèk sumisyon youn lòt nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:11">II Kor 5:11</ref></char></note>lakrent Kris la.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22-6:9">Ef 5:22—6:9</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18-4:1">Kol 3:18—4:1</ref></char>
    </note>Madanm, se pou nou soumèt a mari nou, tankou a Senyè a. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:3">I Kor 11:3</ref></char></note>mari a se tèt a madanm nan, jan Kris osi se tèt a legliz la. Se Li menm ki Sovè a kò a. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Men jan legliz la soumèt a Kris la, menm jan an madanm yo dwe soumèt yo a mari yo nan tout bagay.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:28">Ef 5:28</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 5:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:2">Ef 5:2</ref></char>
    </note>Mari, renmen madanm nou, jan Kris osi te renmen legliz la, e te bay tèt Li pou Li, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref></char></note>pou Li te kapab fè l sen, pandan Li te netwaye li nan lave l avèk dlo e avèk pawòl la. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Pou Li te kapab prezante legliz la a Li menm nan tout glwa li, san tach, e san pli, oubyen okenn lòt bagay konsa; men pou li ta kapab vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:4">Ef 1:4</ref></char></note>sen e san fot. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Donk, mari yo dwe osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Ef 5:25</ref></char></note>renmen pwòp madanm yo kon pwòp kò yo. Sila ki renmen madanm li renmen pwòp tèt li. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Paske pèsòn pa t janm rayi pwòp chè li, men nouri li e pran swen de li, menm jan ke Kris fè osi pou legliz la. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Paske nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:15">I Kor 6:15</ref></char></note>manm a kò Li. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Jen 2:24</ref></char></note>“Pou rezon sila a, yon nonm va kite manman l ak papa l pou atache ak madanm li, epi yo de a va devni yon sèl chè.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Mistè sa a gran, men m ap pale avèk referans a Kris ak legliz la. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Sepandan, se pou chak moun pami nou renmen madanm li kon pwòp tèt li, e madanm lan dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:2">I Pi 3:2</ref>,<ref loc="1PE 3:5">5</ref></char></note>respekte mari li.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 6:20">Pwov 6:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zanfan yo, obeyi a paran nou nan Senyè a, paske se sa ki bon. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Egz 20:12</ref></char></note>Onore Papa ou ak manman ou, ki se premye kòmandman ki vini avèk yon pwomès; <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />pou li kapab ale byen avèk ou, e pou ou kapab viv anpil tan sou latè.<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Papa yo, pa pwovoke pitit nou yo a lakòlè, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Kol 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:19">Jen 18:19</ref></char></note>elve yo nan disiplin ak enstriksyon a Senyè a.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:22">Kol 3:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Esklav yo, se pou nou obeyisan a sila ki mèt nou yo selon lachè, avèk lakrent ak tranbleman, nan senserite a kè nou, tankou a Kris la menm, <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />pa sèlman devan zye, kòmsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:10">Gal 1:10</ref></char></note>pou fè moun plezi, men kòm esklav a Kris k ap fè tout volonte Bondye ki soti nan kè a. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Avèk bòn volonte, rann sèvis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:23">Kol 3:23</ref></char></note>tankou a Senyè a, e pa a lòm <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />nan konesans ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref></char></note>nenpòt bon bagay yon moun fè, li va resevwa sa a soti nan Senyè a, kit li esklav kit li lib.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Epi mèt yo, fè menm bagay yo pou yo. Sispann menase yo, lòske nou konprann ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:13">Job 31:13</ref></char></note>ni Mèt pa yo a ak pa nou an se nan syèl la, epi devan Li pa gen patipri.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Anfen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:13">I Kor 16:13</ref></char></note>se pou nou vin fò nan Senyè a ak nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:19">Ef 1:19</ref></char></note>fòs a pouvwa Li. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Wo 13:12</ref></char></note>Mete tout pwotèj Bondye a sou nou pou nou kapab kanpe fèm kont tout riz Satan yo. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Paske lit nou an pa kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:17">Mat 16:17</ref></char></note>lachè ak san, men kont wayòm yo, kont pouvwa yo, kont fòs mondyal a tenèb sila a, kont fòs lespri mechan yo nan lye selès yo. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Konsa, se pou nou pran tout pwotèj a Bondye a nèt pou nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:7">Jc 4:7</ref></char></note>reziste nan move jou a, epi lè nou fin fè tout bagay, pou nou kanpe fèm. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Konsa, kanpe fèm, kòmsi nou te fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">És 11:5</ref></char></note>kouvri ren nou avèk Verite a, e mete sou lestomak la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">És 59:17</ref></char></note>pwotèj ladwati a. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">És 52:7</ref></char></note>abiye pye nou avèk preparasyon levanjil lapè a, <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />e anplis de tout bagay, pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:8">I Tes 5:8</ref></char></note>boukliye lafwa a pou nou kapab etenn tout flèch dife a Mechan an. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Epi pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">És 59:17</ref></char></note>kas Sali a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:12">Eb 4:12</ref></char></note>nepe Lespri a, ki se pawòl Bondye a. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Avèk tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:6">Fil 4:6</ref></char></note>lapriyè ak siplikasyon, priye nan Lespri a tout tan, e avèk tout sa an konsiderasyon, rete vijilan avèk tout pèseverans ak siplikasyon pou tout fidèl yo. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:3">Kol 4:3</ref></char></note>Priye pou mwen, pou mo yo va bay a mwen menm, pou lè m ouvri bouch mwen, mwen kapab fè konnen avèk kouraj, mistè a levanjil la, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />pou sila ke mwen se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:20">II Kor 5:20</ref></char></note>anbasadè anchene; pou nan pwoklame li, mwen kab pale avèk kouraj, jan mwen ta dwe pale a.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Ef 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-9">Kol 4:7-9</ref></char>
    </note>Men pou nou menm osi kapab konnen sikonstans mwen yo, jan mwen ye, Tychique, frè byeneme e sèvitè fidèl nan Senyè a, va fè nou konnen tout bagay. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Mwen te voye li kote nou pou bi sa a menm, pou nou ta kapab konnen sikonstans nou menm, e pou Li ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:2">Kol 2:2</ref></char></note>rekonfòte kè nou.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Lapè avèk frè nou yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5:6</ref></char></note>lanmou avèk lafwa, ki soti nan Bondye, Papa a, ak Senyè a Jésus Kri. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Lagras avèk tout sila yo ki renmen Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, avèk yon lanmou ki p ap janm varye. Amen.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>